# Redirect non-static API routes to the Worker (marketnow.site)
# Specific routes (more specific = higher priority) go BEFORE wildcards
# Static JSON files are excluded (served directly by Pages)
#
# IMPORTANT: Only redirect routes where the Worker has an explicit SSR handler.
# Routes NOT handled by Worker (SPA-only) MUST NOT redirect — they cause
# infinite fetch loops (Worker proxy → Pages 301 redirect → Worker → ...)

